\r\nElo   | 34.86 +- 16.92 (95%)\r\nConf  | 40.0+0.40s Threads=1 Hash=128MB\r\nGames | N: 350 W: 56 L: 21 D: 273\r\nPenta | [0, 15, 113, 44, 3]\r\nhttps://chess.swehosting.se/test/5914/\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Selecting a Binary\r\nIf possible, choose the `avx2` version."}